F Learning -> A Brain, 004b: the Question jar, wired (round 7 F item 8; supersedes the prose of 004-question-jar.md)
Base: claude/r4-conversation @ 2b991812f. Apply with: git apply docs/patches/to-brain/004b-question-jar.patch
Needs Learning's server/learner/jar.js from claude/r7-learning (jarLaterEntries, jarServed, emitJarEvents, and
jarItemsFromLesson skipping carried entries). It reaches int/r6 with Learning's PR #51.
Land AFTER the director4 run (main 2026-11-05), so that run measures one change.

What it does:
  1. lesson end (routes/lesson.js endLesson): unserved parked questions go into question_jar in the end transaction (before
     the Conductor's rows, which stay last), with teacher.promise emitted after the commit; never from a safeguarded lesson.
  2. next lesson start (routes/lesson.js + director/state.js warm-up start + shapes.js returnJar): learnerView.jar rides in
     as Later entries, and the greeting comes back to the first one ("what they asked last time").
  3. kept (start tx + brain/turn.js turn tx): a carried entry served this step marks its jar row answered and emits
     teacher.promise_kept, which drops the Conductor's promise. A carried entry left unserved is never written twice.
Tests: tests/r7-brain-question-jar.test.mjs (the three behaviours); tests/w2-seams.test.mjs (tx order allows the jar rows).
Gates on the base with this patch applied: tsc, vite build, all four shards green.

